      "title": "Cinderella's Name",
      "body": "Her stepsisters mockingly call her \"Cinderella\" because, once her chores are done, she sits near the fireplace hearth to keep warm, leaving her covered in cinders and ash - a nickname that stuck despite her being, by everyone's account, the loveliest of the three girls.",
